<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450374" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 18 — Table Between Numbered List in a Workflow</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d533e7">
         <p>Consider a workflow represented as a numbered list where the author inserts a reference table between lifecycle stages.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Table between stages in workflow</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_acq_tgp_lkc">
&lt;h2 id="deployment-lifecycle">
  Deployment Environment Lifecycle
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>
  The following workflow shows the deployment lifecycle.
&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
  &lt;li>Development Environment&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;table>
  &lt;caption>Environment responsibilities&lt;/caption>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;th>Environment&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Purpose&lt;/th>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>Development&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Feature implementation&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>Staging&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Pre-production validation&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
&lt;/table>
&lt;ol>
  &lt;li>Staging Environment&lt;/li>
  &lt;li>Production Environment&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                <codeblock id="codeblock_b2f_cvt_lkc">
&lt;concept id="deployment_environment_lifecycle">
  &lt;title>Deployment Environment Lifecycle&lt;/title>
  &lt;conbody>
    &lt;p>
      The following workflow shows the deployment lifecycle.
    &lt;/p>
    &lt;ol>
      &lt;li>
        Development Environment
        &lt;table>
          &lt;title>Environment responsibilities&lt;/title>
          &lt;tgroup cols="2">
            &lt;colspec colname="c1"/>
            &lt;colspec colname="c2"/>
            &lt;thead>
              &lt;row>
                &lt;entry>Environment&lt;/entry>
                &lt;entry>Purpose&lt;/entry>
              &lt;/row>
            &lt;/thead>
            &lt;tbody>
              &lt;row>
                &lt;entry>Development&lt;/entry>
                &lt;entry>Feature implementation&lt;/entry>
              &lt;/row>
              &lt;row>
                &lt;entry>Staging&lt;/entry>
                &lt;entry>Pre-production validation&lt;/entry>
              &lt;/row>
            &lt;/tbody>
          &lt;/tgroup>
        &lt;/table>
      &lt;/li>
      &lt;li>Staging Environment&lt;/li>
      &lt;li>Production Environment&lt;/li>
    &lt;/ol>
  &lt;/conbody>
&lt;/concept></codeblock>
              </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>
            <b>Result:</b> The converter treats the inserted table as content inside the numbered workflow structure — the table is nested inside the preceding <codeph>&lt;li&gt;</codeph> and the list stays as a single, unsplit <codeph>&lt;ol&gt;</codeph>.</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
